Design: We add the RandomErasing augmentation to the training pipeline, applying it after normalization to improve model robustness and generalization. The rest of the training loop remains unchanged, including mixup and test‐time augmentation. We replace the initial Resize+RandomRotation with RandomResizedCrop for additional scale invariance. We then retrain DenseNet121 for 5 epochs and report the validation TTA AUROC.
